      },
      {
        "href": "https://www.microburbs.com.au/definitions/alienation-level",
        "text": "Alienation Levels IndexThe frequency of feelings of detachment from society or community for people, measured as a score. A high alienation score can reflect poorly on the strength of the community in the region.Learn more",
        "title": "",
