      },
      {
        "href": "https://www.microburbs.com.au/definitions/average-welfare-payments",
        "text": "Average Welfare PaymentsThe average government payments and allowances received for each recipient, including, but not limited to, Age Pension, JobSeeker Payment, and Youth Allowance. It is important to note the varying types of people which receive welfare, from unemployed people to disabled people. Also note that high rates of welfare payments in a region can inadvertently create an income growth ceiling.Learn more",
        "title": "",
        "base_domain": "microburbs.com.au",
